' Máquina de estados de Order — TechStore U4
' Formato UML clásico del curso. Renderizar en plantuml.com o con la extensión de VS Code.
@startuml
title Máquina de estados de Order — TechStore U4

[*] --> DRAFT : creación

DRAFT --> CONFIRMED : confirm() / OrderConfirmed
CONFIRMED --> SHIPPED : ship(guia) / OrderShipped
SHIPPED --> DELIVERED : deliver() / OrderDelivered
SHIPPED --> RETURNED : return_order() / OrderReturned
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancel(motivo) / OrderCancelled

DRAFT --> [*]
DELIVERED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
RETURNED --> [*]
@enduml
